# Build context of services/avrana-home (Dockerfile.preview). Deny everything, then allow the three inputs.
*
!requirements.lock
!avrana_home/
!preview/
# Never in an image, even if a rule above changes: development shims and mocks, tests, secrets, env files.
dev/
tests/
webtests/
contracts/
secrets/
*.env
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
